  "apolloState_ActivityText_sample": {
    "ActivityText:526372": {
      "__typename": "ActivityText",
      "id": "526372",
      "text": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">[에피소든] 대학생 글로벌 영어 멘토 1기 모집 (~9/30)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">(Episoden Global English Mentoring)</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-03015160-7fff-991a-1c3f-a8e6a0bbcf02\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">📢 이력서에 단순 영어 점수만 쓰실 건가요?</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">스펙과 영어 실력을 한 번에 챙기는 가장 쉬운 대외활동 등장!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">전 세계 사람들과 영어로 소통하고 글로벌 기업 공식 멘토 수료증 받아가세요!</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">면접 ❌, 공인 점수 제출 필수 ❌</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">⏰ 스케줄은 100% 내 맘대로! 언제 어디서든, 내가 원할 때 참여 ⏰</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">🔥 이런 분이라면 망설이지 말고 지원하세요! 🔥&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">영어 회화, 외국인 친구 사귀기, 대외활동 스펙까지 몽땅 챙기고 싶은 분</span></p></li></ul><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">토익/오픽 점수 외에 “실제 영어 활용 경험”을 자소서/이력서에 녹여내고 싶은 분</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">AI가 아닌 “실제 사람”과 영어로 대화해 보고 싶은 분</span></p></li></ul><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 구글 폼 링크: </span><a href=\"https://forms.gle/qiCN8R9mF2j4k2cC8\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">https://forms.gle/qiCN8R9mF2j4k2cC8</span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">🌏 쿠팡을 포함한 한·미·일 글로벌 투자사가 선택한 170개국 화상 대화 플랫폼 '에피소든'에서 대학생 글로벌 영어 멘토를 모집합니다!</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">전 세계 사람들과 영어로 대화하고, 자신보다 영어가 익숙지 않은 사용자가 편하게 말하도록 돕는 글로벌 멘토 역할을 하게 됩니다.</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">📌 모집 및 활동 안내</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">모집기간: 2026년 8월 1일 ~ 2026년 9월 30일</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">모집대상: 영어에 관심 있는 대학생 누구나 (휴학생, 졸업예정자, 졸업유예생 모두 환영!)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'Malgun Gothic';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">활동기간: 합격일로부터 3개월 이내</span>